    "body": "## Summary\nSpeeds up `kda_replayssm_exact_fold_kernel`, the `--enable-linear-replayssm-spec` commit that replays each request's accepted draft tokens into its fp32 KDA state.\n\n- V tile `BV` 32 -> 8 (`KDA_FOLD_BLOCK_V`, tuned on GB300), keeping full-K rows and `num_warps=1`.\n- The next accepted token's ring entries (k, v, gate, beta) are loaded while the current token is folded.\n\n## Results\nAll-layer fold on GB300, K=V=128, fp32 state, bf16 k/v ring. Shapes per GPU: GLM-5.3-Flash TP4 (34 KDA layers, 16 heads) and Kimi-K3 TP8 (69 KDA layers, 12 heads). L2 flushed before every call; median of interleaved main/PR runs.\n\n| Model | Batch | Accepted tokens | main (us) | PR (us) | Speedup |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| GLM-5.3-Flash | 1 | 6 | 41.7 | 29.4 | 1.42x |\n| GLM-5.3-Flash | 16 | 3 | 272.7 | 198.6 | 1.37x |\n| GLM-5.3-Flash | 16 | 6 | 422.6 | 278.8 | 1.52x |\n| GLM-5.3-Flash | 32 | 3 | 522.6 | 383.7 | 1.36x |\n| GLM-5.3-Flash | 32 | 6 | 817.4 | 545.5 | 1.50x |\n| GLM-5.3-Flash | 64 | 3 | 1022.7 | 745.5 | 1.37x |\n| GLM-5.3-Flash | 64 | 6 | 1608.7 | 1077.5 | 1.49x |\n| Kimi-K3 | 1 | 3 | 39.2 | 27.0 | 1.45x |\n| Kimi-K3 | 1 | 8 | 68.1 | 45.8 | 1.49x |\n| Kimi-K3 | 16 | 3 | 402.7 | 300.4 | 1.34x |\n| Kimi-K3 | 16 | 8 | 781.4 | 533.5 | 1.46x |\n| Kimi-K3 | 32 | 3 | 788.9 | 587.7 | 1.34x |\n| Kimi-K3 | 32 | 8 | 1533.7 | 1052.7 | 1.46x |\n| Kimi-K3 | 64 | 3 | 1548.6 | 1148.6 | 1.35x |\n| Kimi-K3 | 64 | 8 | 3039.5 | 2093.8 | 1.45x |\n| Kimi-K3 | 128 | 3 | 3067.8 | 2257.6 | 1.36x |\n| Kimi-K3 | 128 | 8 | 6057.0 | 4175.1 | 1.45x |\n\n## Correctness\nFolded state is bit-identical to main for both shape sets at batch 1/2/16/32/64/128 with 1/3/6/8 accepted tokens, mixed per-request accept lengths (0-8), and the `extra_buffer` track snapshot. `test_kda_replayssm_ring_fused.py` and `test_kda_replayssm_fold_batched.py` pass.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38373378683](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38373378683)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38373378283](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38373378283)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38373378972](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38373378972)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
